## chart main DogSwipe UX Release Gantt
```mermaid
gantt
  title DogSwipe UX Release Gantt
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat %b %d

  section Design Extraction
  Design zip audit      :done, design-audit, 2026-05-07, 1d
  Opus review wave      :done, opus-review, 2026-05-07, 1d

  section SwiftUI Hardening
  Discover card polish  :done, discover-ui, 2026-05-07, 1d
  Screen headers        :done, headers, 2026-05-07, 1d
  Match and order cues  :done, match-order, 2026-05-07, 1d
  Vendor status polish  :done, vendor-status, 2026-05-07, 1d

  section Verification
  Quality gates         :done, quality-gates, 2026-05-07, 1d
  Completion audit      :done, audit, after quality-gates, 1d
  Commit batches        :done, commit, after audit, 1d

  section Release
  Deploy verification   :done, release-verify, after commit, 1d
  TestFlight handoff    :crit, done, testflight, after release-verify, 1d
  Device auth proof     :crit, active, device-proof, after testflight, 1d
```

## chart design-proof Design Proof
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  zip["supplied prototype zip"]
  tokens["tokens.css: paper, mustard, tomato, relish, super blue"]
  shared["ui.jsx: ScreenHeader, StatusPill, CraveMeter"]
  discover["screens/discover.jsx: price/status hero overlays"]
  release["screens/orders/matches/vendor/review/profile"]
  swift["SwiftUI design system and app surfaces"]

  zip --> tokens
  zip --> shared
  zip --> discover
  zip --> release
  tokens --> swift
  shared --> swift
  discover --> swift
  release --> swift
```

## chart quality-proof Quality Proof
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SwiftPackage
  SwiftPackage --> IOSBuild
  IOSBuild --> UISmoke
  UISmoke --> Drift
  Drift --> Coverage
  Coverage --> Crap
  Crap --> MMDX
  MMDX --> ReleaseAssets
  ReleaseAssets --> DeployReadiness
  DeployReadiness --> [*]
```

